---
/**
 * Services — Hero
 * Figma: "Frame 2147232974" (10103:138), 1728×792
 * https://www.figma.com/design/9SsfbCUY7KcxjZpCuRpDxf/Hello-Robo-Website-2026?node-id=10103-138
 */
---
<section class="services-hero container">
  <h1 class="services-hero__title t-h1">
    We design every reason<br />to say yes
    <img class="services-hero__stamp" src="/images/services/stamp-thinkers.svg" alt="" width="252" height="82" />
  </h1>
  <div class="services-hero__intro">
    <p class="t-body">Our services</p>
    <p class="services-hero__text t-body">
      We start with what people need to understand, trust and believe before they say yes. Then we bring brand, product and film together as one system — grounded in real behavior, made clear through design and built for operators, the market and the world.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-hero {
    padding-top: var(--space-40);
    padding-bottom: 39px;
  }
  .services-hero__title {
    position: relative;
    width: 1233px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  /* Stamp sits after "to say yes" on the second line (539,175 in the frame) */
  .services-hero__stamp {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: baseline;
    width: 252px;
    height: auto;
    margin-left: 12px;
  }
  .services-hero__intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: calc(830 / 1648 * 100%) 680px;
    margin-top: 389px;
  }
</style>
